1.3 Typography
• One family: Hind Siliguri (Bangla and Latin look consistent). Fallback: system-ui, sans-serif.
• Scale: H1 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem) / 1.2, weight 700. H2 2rem, 700. H3 1.2rem, 600. Body 1rem / 1.6, 400. Small 0.85rem. Buttons 600.
• Keep paragraphs under about 34 em wide. Left-align everything except the final call-to-action and the stats band.
• Numbers: a setting switches between Bangla (১২৩) and English (123) numerals everywhere, including GPA and tables.
1.4 Icons
• Prototype uses emoji; production should use one line-icon set (Lucide), 24px, stroke 1.75.
• Every feature icon sits in a 46px tile with 13px radius filled with the Brand gradient and white glyph. Sidebar icons are bare 24px glyphs, white at 80% opacity, 100% when active.
• Icon map: Institutions 🏫, Users 👥, Notices 📢, Audit 🛡️, Classes 📚, Teachers 👩‍🏫, Students 🎓, Exams 📝, Marks ✍️, Approval ✅, Tabulation 🧮, Settings ⚙️, Assignments 📎, Admit card 🪪, Academic year 🗓️.
1.5 Shape, depth and spacing
• Radius: inputs 10px, buttons 12px, cards 16px, forms and glass cards 20px, stats band 22px, pills fully round.
• Shadow: cards 0 10px 30px rgba(40,50,120,.10); floating elements 0 20px 50px rgba(11,20,55,.35).
• Spacing on an 8px grid. Public sections use 64px vertical padding and a 1250px maximum width. Dashboard content padding is 24px.
1.6 Motion tokens
• Durations: 150ms (hover colour), 300ms (card lift, sidebar items), 450ms (page content entrance), 700ms (scroll reveal), 9–14s (ambient background loops).
• Easing: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) for entrances, ease-in-out for loops.
• Rule: one signature moment per page (home: the floating result card over the drifting hero). Everything else is quiet and responds to the user’s action.
• Everything respects “reduced motion”: loops stop, reveals show instantly.
1.6a Imagery style
• Illustrations: flat semi-3D, using only the palette above, soft shadows, no outlines.
• Photos: real classroom and campus scenes from Bangladesh, shown with a navy-to-indigo duotone overlay (#0B1437 at 55%) so text stays readable and photos match the theme.
• Never use stock images with watermarks or foreign school uniforms. Every image has alt text and is under 200 KB (WebP).
