14. Responsive and accessibility rules
• Breakpoints: 860px (drawer sidebar, single-column hero) and 560px (one-column cards, full-width buttons).
• Text contrast at least 4.5:1; white text only on navy, indigo or violet, never on amber or the light end of teal.
• Visible amber focus ring on every control; every icon-only button has a label.
• Status is never shown by colour alone: pills always carry text.
• Tables scroll horizontally inside their own container; printed marksheets and admit cards ignore dark mode.